\": \"I am ten years old\" hoặc ngắn gọn \"I am ten\". Không nói \"I have ten years\".\nSố: 20 = twenty, 28 = twenty-eight (có gạch nối), 100 = a hundred / one hundred.\n\"How many + danh từ số nhiều\": How many pens? How many cats?","lessonId":"u4n5l6","lessonVersion":"v2.u4n5l6","manifestHash":"013672aa5927648264926e14d514d9d670ba04f547fc10aba6d50095b8e8b587","nodeId":"u4n5","order":28,"rewardIdentity":"v2.u4n5l6","schemaVersion":1,"sectionId":"sec1","signature":"XXJwwxgfdZ4WV_QM7mf1SatFhtta05YeavXXy8Y8Et1b_jGncBbo5d6sWlZyGq9-5ERrFnOYupkIKwTt0rqMDw","signatureKeyId":"dev-content-1","skillIds":["listening","u4.grammar","u4.vocab"],"title":"Số điện thoại · Bài 6","unitId":"u4"}